                <content>
                  <p>Repeal the paragraph, substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-4__part-1__amdact-2__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-4__part-1__amdact-2__item-4__qstr-1__para-c">
                    <num>c</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(c)	if the related licence is a CTV licence within the meaning of the <i>Broadcasting Services Act 1992</i>—does not have effect after 30 June 2024.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>7  Application of amendments</p>
                      <p>The amendments made by items 4 to 6 of this Schedule apply in relation to apparatus licences regardless of when the licences were issued.</p>
                    </content>
